<title>SRI LANKA: Grain records loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>Grain records loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Ceylon Grain Elevators Ltd, for the 12 months ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		 2,724.77   vs    2,497.47</p>
<p>    Net profit/(loss)     (52.21)   vs	171.56</p>
<p>    Tax			   15.34   vs	 47.87</p>
<p>NOTE - Ceylon Grain Elevators, a unit of Prima Ltd of Singapore, mills animal feed and supplies chicken and day-old-chicks to the local market. The company was badly hit in 1996 by high world market prices of grain, and crippling power cuts due to a sevre drought.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
